            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉奇鋐水冷產品展望正面 周漲逾3成收復月線",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">散熱廠奇鋐(3017-TW)受惠水冷散熱需求強勁，今年前三季稅後純益290.47億元，年增1.32倍，每股純益73.86元，賺逾7個股本，奇鋐指出，隨著ASIC與GPU客戶陸續採用水冷產品，預期滲透率將持續提升，展望正面，激勵奇鋐本周大漲逾3成，並收復月線。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">奇鋐本周漲31.6%，周四(12日)衝上3060元，周五(13日)收3040元，同步收復5日線、月線與半年線。至於三大法人本周籌碼動向，外資連5賣後，周五回頭買超479張，三大法人本周買超306張。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-02f5f706-0346-3377-b89a-a35f972814b0-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">奇鋐表示，隨著CSP客戶逐漸提高自研晶片使用量，將帶動ASIC成長，且預期明年ASIC營收貢獻將超越GPU。公司並指出，ASIC客戶已全面導入雙面水冷板，加上部分GPU客戶也開始採用，預期至2027年底，ASIC與GPU全面導入水冷。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">為因應強勁需求，奇鋐持續擴充產能，目前水冷板月產能約100萬片，預計明年將擴充50%以上，並同步提升機箱產能。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d704b9ad19df521c0c4043c00758f2646e8062d4fe9c0dce61d02b11a8e8142c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fc24d55bb854a22fde83fa8e4595ca1d0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"奇鋐前三季賺逾七個股本 明年ASIC營收貢獻將超越GPU\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:奇鋐前三季賺逾七個股本 明年ASIC營收貢獻將超越GPU;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6656704?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">奇鋐前三季賺逾七個股本 明年ASIC營收貢獻將超越GPU</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"奇鋐10月營收221億元年增逾3成 連四月刷新單月歷史新高\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:奇鋐10月營收221億元年增逾3成 連四月刷新單月歷史新高;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6652996?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">奇鋐10月營收221億元年增逾3成 連四月刷新單月歷史新高</a></p></div>",
